    "description": "Career Launcher Holdings Services invites applications from qualified candidates for the position of Subject Matter Expert at our Lucknow location. This role offers excellent career advancement prospects.\n\nAbout Career Launcher Holdings Services:\nCareer Launcher Holdings Services is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Design formative and summative assessments aligned to learning objectives\n• Develop and deliver engaging lesson plans for students\n• Contribute to school newsletter, blogs, and other publications\n• Utilize technology and digital tools to enhance learning outcomes\n• Participate in school events, workshops, and training programs\n• Create curriculum-aligned learning materials and assessments\n• Collaborate with faculty on curriculum development initiatives\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Any graduate with relevant experience\n• 12-20 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in LMS Platforms\n• Proficiency in Student Assessment\n• Proficiency in Lesson Planning\n• Proficiency in Data Analysis\n• Proficiency in Pedagogy\n• Proficiency in Zoom/Teams\n• Proficiency in Special Education\n• Proficiency in MS Office\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• Learning & development budget\n• Mobile and internet reimbursement\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Salary Range: 35 LPA - 70 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Lucknow, Uttar Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Career Launcher Holdings Services!",
